      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 31,
      "end_line": 49,
      "raw": "```qml\nimport QtQuick\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.AppBootstrapWindow {\n    width: 900\n    height: 620\n    title: \"MyApp\"\n\n    pageRoutes: [\n        { path: \"/\", component: homePage }\n    ]\n\n    Component {\n        id: homePage\n        Item {}\n    }\n}\n```\n",
      "language": "qml",
      "code": "import QtQuick\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.AppBootstrapWindow {\n    width: 900\n    height: 620\n    title: \"MyApp\"\n\n    pageRoutes: [\n        { path: \"/\", component: homePage }\n    ]\n\n    Component {\n        id: homePage\n        Item {}\n    }\n}\n",
      "closed": true
